1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:07,459
Mom just got this text. A prosecutor says her account is linked to a crime. Move the money today. Tell no one.

2
00:00:07,809 --> 00:00:17,611
She believes it, and opens her bank app. Before the money moves, the bank asks Scam Shield. Risk ninety-eight. Transfer held. Mom didn't have to spot a thing.

3
00:00:17,961 --> 00:00:25,315
Scams like this cost Koreans a record one point two six trillion won last year. Up forty-seven percent.

4
00:00:25,666 --> 00:00:31,291
Most losses come from fake authorities, and victims in their sixties are up eighty-five percent.

5
00:00:31,641 --> 00:00:41,564
Mom never has to spot the scam. Risky transfers trigger it at the bank. Next, messages get screened automatically. Forwarding is just the fallback.

6
00:00:41,914 --> 00:00:49,076
Her son Joon, in Singapore, is alerted live: Mom is trying to send thirty million won to a new account.

7
00:00:49,426 --> 00:00:56,899
He taps block. Only her real child, on his own signed-in device, can release a hold. A cloned voice can't.

8
00:00:57,250 --> 00:01:00,140
Mom's bank screen updates instantly.

9
00:01:00,490 --> 00:01:12,284
Under the hood, deterministic tools extract indicators, scan a Korean scam playbook and assess the transfer. Claude reasons. Then a fixed policy holds anything at sixty or above.

10
00:01:12,634 --> 00:01:15,980
So the AI can hold money. It can never release it.

11
00:01:16,329 --> 00:01:22,939
And a prompt-injected 'this is safe' can't talk it down. Two playbook signals floor the risk at seventy.

12
00:01:23,289 --> 00:01:27,019
Every step is saved as a timestamped warning record.

13
00:01:27,369 --> 00:01:34,723
Built today: Next.js, Supabase Realtime and Claude. Fourteen of fourteen tests pass.

14
00:01:35,073 --> 00:01:41,947
SKT's family care covers calls, one way. We sit at the transfer, across banks, before money moves.

15
00:01:42,297 --> 00:01:49,603
Banks pay. The pending no-fault bill exempts banks that sufficiently warned the customer. Our record is that proof.

16
00:01:49,953 --> 00:01:54,739
Scam Shield. Mom's money can't move until her real child confirms.

